{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"We know that $s(t)=\\displaystyle \\int v(t) \\,dt$. ","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In this case, $s(t)=\\displaystyle \\int 3t+2 \\,dt$\n\n","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's find the indefinite integral:\n\n$\\begin{align}\\displaystyle \\int 3t+2 \\,dt\u0026=\\dfrac{3}{2}t^2+2t+C\\\\\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"We know that $s(0)=3$.  Let's use this information to solve for $C$.\n\n$\\begin{align}s(t)\u0026=\\dfrac{3}{2}t^2+2t+C\\\\\n\\\\\ns(0)\u0026=\\dfrac{3}{2}(0)^2+2(0)+C\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n3\u0026=C\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"**The position of the particle $s(t)$ at any time $t$ is $s(t)=\\dfrac32t^2+2t+3$.**","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"The velocity of a particle moving along the $x$-axis is $v(t)=3t+2$.  At $t=0$, its position is $3$.\n\n**What is the position of the particle, $s(t)$, at any time $t$?**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]\n\n","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$s(t)=3$","correct":false},{"content":"$s(t)=3t^2+2t+3$","correct":false},{"content":"$s(t)=\\dfrac32t^2+2t$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"$s(t)=\\dfrac32t^2+2t+3$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
